# Database dumps from ops/migrate-to-eu.sh.
#
# The script now defaults to writing outside the repo, but its old default was
# ./migration-<timestamp>/, and OUT can still be pointed anywhere. These files
# contain every employee record, every salary and the whole audit log, so the
# ignore stays as a second line of defence. scripts/check-secrets.sh is the third.
migration-[0-9]*-[0-9]*/
*/data.sql
*/roles.sql
